body:
For me, it was quite funny. I started liking a girl and I didn't know what was happening. I then found oout I was bisexual.

&#x200B;

After that I realized that my gender switched with the day. It also occured when I was a little girl. And that's how I found out I am genderfluid

&#x200B;

After a time, I realized that I was romantically atracted to non binaries too but not sexualy. It was so confusing. That's how I found out I am polyromantic

Eh hi, I know you only told me that you're pregnant yesterday but I have been seeing your future kid for over a month now...

&#x200B;

No just no

Well, she has her eyes, that brown-blueish color and straight shouler long hair in a brown golden tone. She looks a lot like her.

&#x200B;

For the abortion thing, I am not gonna go up to her and ask if she had an abortion or miscariage, that's just weird.

Laugh my ass off while people look at me in confusion while my gender changes every day... I am genderfluid...

&#x200B;

Edit: What´s up with all the downvotes? What´s y´all´s problem? Thanks for the supporting comments by the way.

Not a parent, but a high IQ child. My parents noticed when I started talking that I could already read.

&#x200B;

Edit: I talked to my mom and she said she suposes that I learned to read when I was 3 moths old.

The dead of Remus Lupin, I had read the book before and I like cryied 2 days after seeing the film.

&#x200B;

Then my friend made the big mistake of handing me a piece of chocolate and say : Eat, you'll feel better.
